   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Image to image: redraws the input picture following the prompt.\nDenoise = how much changes: 0.3 keeps the picture and fixes details, 0.6 (default 0.6) restyles it, 0.85+ keeps only the rough layout.\nThe input is resized to about 1.0 megapixels first (Working size).\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
